<title>USA: No bids/offers for U.S. southbound barge freight.</title>
<headline>No bids/offers for U.S. southbound barge freight.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. southbound barge freight was not quoted on Thursday at the St. Louis Merchants Exchange. No barges traded versus none on Monday.</p>
<p>There were no bids or offers.  </p>
<p>There will be no call session on Tuesday, December 31 or January 1, the exchange said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
